ection is complete for AuditBExport.P. Actual axioms are exactly Classical.choice, Quot.sound and propext, equal to permitted foundations; unexpected_axioms and unproved_project_declarations are empty. This judgment uses recorded native evidence, not a compiler run performed by this reviewer, and encoded-signature checks alone were not treated as semantic evidence.\",\"locations\":[\"/scope\",\"/endpoints\",\"/mechanical_summary\",\"/scope/exported_root\",\"/endpoints/P/actual\",\"/documents\",\"/mechanical_summary/native_evidence_origin\",\"/mechanical_summary/assembly\",\"/mechanical_summary/inspection\",\"/mechanical_summary/local_proof_checks\",\"/mechanical_summary/closure\"]}}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read one declared frozen document. For JSON use pointer (empty string lists the root); large objects return keys, and strings resume with offset=next_offset. For text use inclusive start/end lines and column=next_column when continuing a long line. Every serialized result is at most 32 KiB. Follow has_more and the returned continuation coordinates; no arbitrary local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"},"column":{"type":"integer"},"pointer":{"type":"string"},"off